---
flowchart TD
    accTitle: Natural Telegram conversation and one shared outreach workflow
    accDescr: Telegram messages enter a saved queue. A LangGraph conversation loop remembers recent exchanges, reads files or public websites, searches when configured, and answers. Outreach requests become a concrete proposal; after the owner starts it, the existing outreach graph researches, qualifies, checks contacts, writes, reviews, and pauses for exact-message approval. The dashboard and optional guided setup use the same outreach service. SQLite holds jobs, history, evidence, usage, checkpoints and approvals.
    telegram["Private Telegram<br/>Normal messages, files and decisions"] --> service["Shared service<br/>Saved queue and one worker"]
    dashboard["Owner dashboard<br/>Connections and controls"] --> service
    service --> chat["LANGGRAPH CONVERSATION<br/>Understand message + recent history"]
    chat -->|Read evidence| tools["Bounded read-only tools<br/>Files · browser · search · run status"]
    tools --> chat
    chat -->|Answer or clarify| answer["Reply in Telegram<br/>Continue the conversation"]
    chat -->|Outreach requested| proposal["Show request + Start outreach button"]
    proposal -->|Owner starts it| files["Optional uploaded files<br/>Read text / local OCR · save cited evidence"]
    service -->|Dashboard or guided outreach| files
    files --> goal["LANGGRAPH<br/>Interpret the goal"]
    goal --> research["Research prospects + sources<br/>Files · notes · Brave · public browser"]
    research --> qualification{"Qualified prospects?"}
    qualification -->|Yes| recipients["Resolve recipient addresses<br/>Published evidence or owner selection"]
    qualification -->|No| outcome["Save outcomes + relationship history"]
    recipients --> memory["Retrieve memory + Gmail history<br/>Apply contact rules"]
    memory -->|Allowed| strategy["Outreach strategy → write email"]
    memory -->|Blocked| outcome
    strategy --> review{"Review passes?"}
    review -->|Pass| approval{"Human approval"}
    review -->|Revise within limit| strategy
    review -->|Limit exhausted| outcome
    approval -->|Edit: review new version| review
    approval -->|Reject| outcome
    approval -->|Approve exact message| action["Recheck account, policy + duplicates<br/>Gmail draft / enabled send / record only"]
    action --> outcome
    store[("SQLite<br/>Jobs, conversation, checkpoints and choices<br/>File text, events and action ledger")]
    service -. Save and resume .-> store
    approval -. Saved pause .-> store
    outcome -. Persist .-> store
    classDef decision fill:#fff6e6,stroke:#caa65d,color:#5b451b;
    classDef storage fill:#edf3fc,stroke:#8da6c7,color:#243b58;
    class qualification,review,approval decision;
    class store,outcome storage;
